{"title":"Rimehide Pelt","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Ice Troll, Ice Troll Brute</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ice-troll-brute\" title=\"Ice Troll Brute - dropped it in 1 of 4 looted corpses (1/4)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/89113af10356d687e501.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ice Troll Brute</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ice-troll\" title=\"Ice Troll - dropped it in 1 of 5 looted corpses (1/5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/e82047e1bfdc2dfa3895.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ice Troll</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"rimehide-pelt\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/b7d951e5ff28740fde62.svg\" alt=\"Rimehide Pelt\"></div><h3>Rimehide Pelt</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/26/2026, 10:42:32 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}